title: "Skylos"
type: software
version: "4.47.2"
abstract: "Skylos is an open-source (Apache-2.0), local-first static analysis CLI and pull-request gate. It finds dead code, security issues, secrets, vulnerable dependencies, quality regressions and AI-code mistakes. Coverage is deepest in Python, TypeScript/JavaScript and Java."
license: "Apache-2.0"
